<view class="page {{skin}}">

  <view class="card">
    <view class="t1">跟读练习</view>
    <view class="muted mt-s">
      先听示范音，再录一遍；录完回放给自己或家长听。
      录音只存这台手机，不上传，最多留 {{maxRecords}} 条，旧的会自动清掉。
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 材料：内置单词 / 自己填一句 / 导入口令 -->
  <view class="card">
    <view class="oral-sub">今天要读什么</view>
    <view class="mode-row mt-s">
      <view class="mode-chip {{mode === 'word' ? 'on' : ''}}" data-mode="word" bindtap="switchMode">单词</view>
      <view class="mode-chip {{mode === 'custom' ? 'on' : ''}}" data-mode="custom" bindtap="switchMode">自己填 / 口令</view>
    </view>

    <block wx:if="{{mode === 'word'}}">
      <input class="inp" value="{{wordInput}}" bindinput="onWordInput" placeholder="输入一个单词，如 apple" />
      <button class="btn sm mt-s" bindtap="useWord">用这个词跟读</button>
    </block>
    <block wx:else>
      <textarea class="inp area" value="{{customText}}" bindinput="onCustomInput" maxlength="200" placeholder="填一句英文，或把老师给的内容粘到这里（不超过 200 字）" />
      <view class="row-between mt-s">
        <button class="btn sm ghost" bindtap="makeCode">生成跟读口令</button>
        <button class="btn sm" bindtap="useCustom">用这段文字跟读</button>
      </view>
    </block>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{codeText}}">
    <view class="oral-sub">跟读口令</view>
    <view class="code-box">{{codeText}}</view>
    <view class="muted mt-s">复制后发给孩子，孩子在下面粘贴导入即可。口令里只有英文文本，不含姓名或手机号。</view>
    <button class="btn sm ghost mt-s" bindtap="copyCode">复制口令</button>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="oral-sub">导入别人的口令</view>
    <textarea class="inp area small" value="{{pasteText}}" bindinput="onPasteInput" placeholder="把口令粘贴到这里" />
    <view class="row-between mt-s">
      <button class="btn sm ghost" bindtap="pasteCode">从剪贴板粘贴</button>
      <button class="btn sm" bindtap="importCode">导入</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{hasRef}}">
    <view class="oral-sub">现在要读</view>
    <view class="ref-text">{{refText}}</view>
    <view class="chips" wx:if="{{chips.length}}">
      <view wx:for="{{chips}}" wx:key="key" class="word-chip {{item.hasAudio ? '' : 'off'}}" data-word="{{item.word}}" bindtap="speakChip">{{item.word}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="muted mt-s">亮色的词点一下能听示范音；灰色词没有内置示范音，照着文本读就行。</view>
  </view>

  <!-- 录音：最长 60 秒自动收尾 -->
  <view class="card">
    <view class="row-between">
      <text class="oral-sub">录音</text>
      <text class="muted">{{stateText}}</text>
    </view>
    <block wx:if="{{state === 'RECORDING'}}">
      <button class="btn mt-s" bindtap="stopRecord">录好了，停</button>
    </block>
    <block wx:else>
      <button class="btn mt-s" bindtap="startRecord">开始录音（最长 60 秒）</button>
    </block>
    <view class="muted mt-s" wx:if="{{tip}}">{{tip}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="row-between">
      <text class="oral-sub">本机录音（{{records.length}} 条）</text>
      <text class="link" bindtap="clearAll">清空</text>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{!records.length}}" class="muted mt-s">还没有录音，上面录一条试试。</view>
    <view wx:for="{{records}}" wx:key="id" class="rec">
      <view class="row-between">
        <text class="rec-ref">{{item.ref_text}}</text>
        <text class="muted">{{item.when}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="muted">{{item.duration}} 秒 · {{item.typeName}}</view>
      <view class="rec-ops">
        <text class="link" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="playRecord">回放</text>
        <text class="link" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="markRead">{{item.marked_read ? '已读 ✓' : '标记已读'}}</text>
        <text class="link" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="markPassed">{{item.passed ? '家长已听 ✓' : '家长确认'}}</text>
        <text class="link" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="removeRecord">删除</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="oral-sub">给老师 / 家长看的汇总</view>
    <view class="muted mt-s">只生成文字统计，不含录音文件；复制后可以在微信里转发。</view>
    <button class="btn sm ghost mt-s" bindtap="makeSummary">生成汇总</button>
    <block wx:if="{{summaryText}}">
      <view class="code-box">{{summaryText}}</view>
      <button class="btn sm ghost mt-s" bindtap="copySummary">复制汇总</button>
    </block>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="muted">
      录音只存在这台手机，不会上传；卸载小程序或点上面的「清空」即删除。换手机不会同步过去。
    </view>
    <button class="btn sm ghost mt-s" open-type="contact" send-message-title="功课抽查 · 跟读练习反馈" show-message-card="true">给开发者留言</button>
  </view>

</view>
